      "content": "This sensation often indicates deep overthinking or sensation amplification, which your brain may be struggling to process at full intensity without red flagging. In such moments, try creating a physical or digital boundary by engaging in grounding techniques like 5-4-3-2-1 sensory exercise to immediately anchor you in your own physical reality. You don't need to \"optimize\" the influx but rather curate input by limiting information sources and scheduling regular rest periods where you are allowed to disconnect completely. Please remember that if these feelings ever cause chemical imbalances or mental health deterioration, reaching out to a counselor is a strong step toward relief.",
